    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1017">

                <pb facs="1033" n="913" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg913"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister
                    Finch.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic">April 17,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(As the Department would greatly regret if complications arose from the seizure
                    of the Canadian schooner <hi rendition="#italic">Agnes G. Donahoe</hi> by the
                    Uruguayan authorities, Mr. Loomis instructs Mr. Finch to use all proper
                    endeavors to bring about peaceable and friendly settlement of the controversy
                    between Uruguay and Great Britain.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
